    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.indentscope\n\n### Description\n\nI would like to have the indentation lines always shown for all indent levels similar to the defaults at [https://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim](https://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim) rather than just the current inner scope at cursor.",
