        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It is intentionally by design. 'indent-blankline.nvim' is already a great plugin for the purpose of displaying all indent guides. And besides that, it might be difficult to implement it efficiently under current design (as it should support animation). I'll think about it.\r\n\r\nIs this similar to #65 or differs in some ways?",
