        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Suggestion for compromise: Offer opt-in option for different colors based on current indent level + type (space or tab). For languages like python (or proper set up formatters), this is sufficient and other code bases only require adjustments to the current indent level + type.\r\nHowever I dont know, if reading current indent level + type is needed and how the current logic works.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, it would be nice to have a plugin suggestion for this use cases, which utilizes asynchronous drawing. ~~The other existing ones are blocking.~~",
