        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Having the option for runtime-configuration would be also helpful until treesitter indent works properly to ensure a documented has proper formatting (languages without formatter implementation etc).\r\nThis would include toggle on/off and expect space/tab with marking the other in a fat red marking, since indentscope overwrites the `charlist` symbols before prefix (to draw the line).\r\n\r\nAlternatively, it would be nice to mention a workaround to draw stuff that works (I guess writing with higher priority than the gitsigns markers) could work.",
